+`prove.sh` recorded:
+
+```text
+EXPECTED FAILURE: false-result mutation was rejected
+```
+
+The A1 body-sensitivity command was:
+
+```bash
+kprove spec-body-mutation.k \
+  --definition verification-kompiled \
