+in `semantics/str.k`. Actual `krun` result: exit 0 with final cells:
+
+```text
+<k> .K </k>
+<env> 0 </env>
+<scopeLoc> 1 </scopeLoc>
+<heap> .Map </heap>
+<heapLoc> 0 </heapLoc>
+<stack> .List </stack>
+<ret> noRet </ret>
+<exc> NoExc </exc>
+<exit-code> 0 </exit-code>
+```
+
+The independent differential command was:
